{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>As He commanded him.</b> It was necessary to say thus, to say that he did not delay, but immediately upon the command, blessed be He, he took the staff. Further, it intends to say that this matter he did <b>as He commanded him</b> — from which you learn that what he did thereafter was not as He commanded him, as we have written above, that he erred in understanding the meaning of the words."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:11:07.699637921Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}